{"seq":2,"slug":"relevance-tuning","title":"相关性调优与评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/practice/relevance-tuning","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"相关性调优与评测\">相关性调优与评测</h1><p>把 <a href=\"../query/ranking-bm25\">BM25 的参数</a> 从默认改成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1=1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span>，搜索是变好了还是变坏了？如果你的答案来自「我试了几个 query 感觉好像好点」，那就是在拿玄学调生产系统。相关性调优的第一性原理是：质量必须先能被量化，才能被优化。这一篇讲怎么用评测指标把「准不准」变成数字，再讲在这个数字闭环里有哪些系统性的调优杠杆。它把前面的 BM25 与 <a href=\"hybrid-vector-search\">混合检索</a> 都纳入「能被度量的优化对象」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-判定集与离线评测闭环\">核心概念：判定集与离线评测闭环</h2><p>一切始于一个判定集（judgment set / qrels）：一组有代表性的查询，每个查询配上「哪些文档与它相关、相关到什么程度」的人工标注（如 0=不相关、1=相关、2=高度相关）。有了它，任何排序结果都能被算出一个分数，于是「改参数→看分数→决定保留或回退」形成可重复的闭环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  JS[&quot;判定集: 查询 + 相关性标注&quot;] --&gt; RUN[&quot;跑当前排序方案&quot;]&#10;  RUN --&gt; METRIC[&quot;计算指标 nDCG / MRR / Recall&quot;]&#10;  METRIC --&gt; CMP{&quot;比基线更好?&quot;}&#10;  CMP --&gt;|是| KEEP[&quot;保留改动&quot;]&#10;  CMP --&gt;|否| REVERT[&quot;回退&quot;]&#10;  KEEP --&gt; CHANGE[&quot;下一个调优假设&quot;]&#10;  REVERT --&gt; CHANGE&#10;  CHANGE --&gt; RUN\">flowchart TD\n  JS[\"判定集: 查询 + 相关性标注\"] --&gt; RUN[\"跑当前排序方案\"]\n  RUN --&gt; METRIC[\"计算指标 nDCG / MRR / Recall\"]\n  METRIC --&gt; CMP{\"比基线更好?\"}\n  CMP --&gt;|是| KEEP[\"保留改动\"]\n  CMP --&gt;|否| REVERT[\"回退\"]\n  KEEP --&gt; CHANGE[\"下一个调优假设\"]\n  REVERT --&gt; CHANGE\n  CHANGE --&gt; RUN</pre><h2 id=\"评测指标-ndcg-mrr-recall-map\">评测指标：nDCG、MRR、Recall、MAP</h2><p>不同指标回答不同问题，选错指标会优化错方向。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Recall@K</td>\n<td>该召回的文档进前 K 了吗</td>\n<td>召回全不全</td>\n<td>RAG 召回阶段、不能漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Precision@K</td>\n<td>前 K 里有多少是相关的</td>\n<td>结果纯不纯</td>\n<td>结果列表质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MRR</td>\n<td>第一个相关结果排第几</td>\n<td>首条命中位置</td>\n<td>导航类、问答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAP</td>\n<td>所有相关结果的平均精度</td>\n<td>整体排序质量</td>\n<td>综合排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nDCG@K</td>\n<td>高相关排得够靠前吗（含分级相关）</td>\n<td>排序 + 分级</td>\n<td>通用首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>nDCG（normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain）是工业界最常用的综合指标，因为它同时考虑「相关程度分级」和「位置折扣」。DCG 把每个位置的相关性增益按位置对数折扣累加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DCG@K</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DCG@K} = \\sum_{i=1}^{K} \\frac{2^{rel_i} - 1}{\\log_2(i + 1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@K</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>排在第 1 位的高相关文档贡献最大，越往后折扣越重；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{rel_i}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 让「高度相关(rel=2)」比「相关(rel=1)」拉开差距。再除以理想排序的 IDCG 归一到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 得 nDCG，使不同查询的分数可比、可平均。当你想知道「整体排序质量」，nDCG 通常是默认选择；当你只关心「第一条对不对」（如智能问答），MRR 更贴切；当下游是 RAG、漏召直接导致答不出，Recall@K 才是主指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调优杠杆-从分析器到字段权重\">调优杠杆：从分析器到字段权重</h2><p>有了度量，调优就是在闭环里逐一验证假设。常见杠杆按「改动面」由小到大：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分析器与同义词：召回不足往往不是排序问题而是 <a href=\"../foundations/text-analysis-tokenization\">分词</a> 问题——词干没还原、同义词没扩、中文切分太粗。先用 Recall 指标定位「是没召回还是排序差」，再决定调分析器还是调打分。</li>\n<li>BM25 参数：按字段特性调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（短字段小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、内容型长文档小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，见 <a href=\"../query/ranking-bm25\">BM25</a>）。</li>\n<li>字段权重：<code>title^3 body^1</code> 之类，但务必用 nDCG 验证而非手感，否则极易过拟合到几个测试 query。</li>\n<li>函数打分 / 业务信号：把新鲜度、销量、点击率等业务信号以衰减函数叠加到文本相关性上（如越新越靠前），平衡相关性与业务目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"学习排序-learning-to-rank\">学习排序（Learning to Rank）</h2><p>当手工调权重撞到天花板，下一步是让模型学习排序（LTR）。思路是把每个「查询-文档」对表示成一组特征向量——BM25 分、各字段分、点击率、新鲜度、向量相似度等——用机器学习模型（如 LambdaMART/GBDT 或神经排序模型）学习一个把特征映射到相关性的函数，直接以 nDCG 这类指标为优化目标。</p>\n<p>LTR 通常作为两阶段排序的第二阶段：第一阶段用 BM25 或 <a href=\"hybrid-vector-search\">混合检索</a> 快速召回前几百条，第二阶段用代价更高的 LTR 模型对这几百条精排。这与混合检索里「召回 + 重排」的范式同构——都是「便宜召回求全、昂贵精排求准」。LTR 的训练数据可以来自人工判定集，也可以从用户点击日志挖掘（隐式反馈），但点击数据有位置偏置等噪声，需要专门处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[&quot;查询&quot;] --&gt; RECALL[&quot;第一阶段: BM25/混合 召回 top 几百&quot;]&#10;  RECALL --&gt; FEAT[&quot;抽特征: BM25分 字段分 点击率 向量相似度 新鲜度&quot;]&#10;  FEAT --&gt; MODEL[&quot;LTR 模型 (以 nDCG 为目标)&quot;]&#10;  MODEL --&gt; RERANK[&quot;精排输出最终顺序&quot;]\">graph TD\n  Q[\"查询\"] --&gt; RECALL[\"第一阶段: BM25/混合 召回 top 几百\"]\n  RECALL --&gt; FEAT[\"抽特征: BM25分 字段分 点击率 向量相似度 新鲜度\"]\n  FEAT --&gt; MODEL[\"LTR 模型 (以 nDCG 为目标)\"]\n  MODEL --&gt; RERANK[\"精排输出最终顺序\"]</pre><h2 id=\"离线与在线-评测的两层\">离线与在线：评测的两层</h2><p>离线评测（用判定集算 nDCG）快、可重复、适合开发期快速迭代，但它只反映标注者的判断，未必等于真实用户满意度。生产系统还需在线评测：A/B 测试把新旧排序方案分流给真实用户，对比点击率、转化率、零结果率等线上指标。两者互补——离线挡住明显退化、快速筛选候选方案，在线做最终裁决。把这套闭环固化下来（判定集版本化、指标自动跑、改动必过门），相关性才能持续演进而不靠运气，这与把搜索系统当工程而非玄学来对待的整体取向一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>相关性调优的前提是量化：先建判定集，形成「改动→算指标→保留/回退」的可重复闭环。</li>\n<li>选对指标：Recall 看召回全不全、MRR 看首条、nDCG 看分级排序质量（工业默认），按场景选主指标。</li>\n<li>调优杠杆由小到大：分析器/同义词（召回）、BM25 参数、字段权重、函数打分叠业务信号；每步用指标验证防过拟合。</li>\n<li>学习排序把多信号特征喂给模型、以 nDCG 为目标做第二阶段精排，与混合检索的召回+重排范式同构。</li>\n<li>离线评测快速筛选、在线 A/B 最终裁决；固化版本化的评测闭环让相关性持续演进而非靠运气。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"相关性调优与评测","id":"相关性调优与评测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：判定集与离线评测闭环","id":"核心概念-判定集与离线评测闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"评测指标：nDCG、MRR、Recall、MAP","id":"评测指标-ndcg-mrr-recall-map"},{"level":2,"text":"调优杠杆：从分析器到字段权重","id":"调优杠杆-从分析器到字段权重"},{"level":2,"text":"学习排序（Learning to Rank）","id":"学习排序-learning-to-rank"},{"level":2,"text":"离线与在线：评测的两层","id":"离线与在线-评测的两层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混合检索与向量融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/practice/hybrid-vector-search"},"next":{"title":"聚合、分面与高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/full-text-search-engine-implementation/practice/aggregations-facets"}}